            <title>Test include</title>
            <theorem id="thm:weiestrass">
                <title>Weierstrass Theorem</title>
                This theorem states that every continuous function defined on a closed interval can be uniformly approximated as closely as desired by a polynomial function. It is a fundamental result in real analysis and has important implications in various areas of mathematics.
            </theorem>
        </section>
    </document>